WEBVTT

00:11:29.375 --> 00:11:31.226
I brought some of that competitiveness

00:11:31.250 --> 00:11:33.726
to the negotiation standpoint
right off the bat.

00:11:33.750 --> 00:11:35.684
AG: When Jason came to class every week,

00:11:35.708 --> 00:11:38.583
he would do intense role plays
negotiating with his peers.

00:11:39.375 --> 00:11:40.726
At the end of the semester,

00:11:40.750 --> 00:11:43.351
I had my entire negotiation
class vote on awards

00:11:43.375 --> 00:11:46.434
like "most cooperative"
and "most creative."

00:11:46.458 --> 00:11:48.309
Jason was the landslide winner

00:11:48.333 --> 00:11:51.601
for a different award, "most ruthless."

00:11:51.625 --> 00:11:54.559
JB: I remember that moment vividly.

00:11:54.583 --> 00:11:56.976
AG: He was so aggressive
in class that word got out

00:11:57.000 --> 00:12:00.976
and students in a different class
also nominated him for most ruthless,